        "III\u2192II reversion raised: genuine incentive to discourage chokepoint escalation raising its own import costs.",
        "Petroyuan/systemic trend continues regardless \u2014 banked passively, not accelerated deliberately.",
        "Moderating influence may be maximized around summit windows and recede afterward."
      ]
    }
